  "bodyHash": "28837927e51fa27f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19 | 1.18 | 1.17 | 1.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Stylish Effects</strong> 徹底改寫了狀態效果的顯示方式。提供多種模式可供選擇，並擁有無數的自訂選項，讓你打造夢寐以求的效果顯示界面。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">首先，原本簡陋的原版 HUD 效果顯示已被更精美的版本取代，新增效果計時器與當前效果等級顯示。此顯示方式也應用於物品欄中，因為它更為緊湊，能在開始重疊前顯示更多效果。而且這個新的物品欄顯示不再僅限於玩家背包，現在你可以在任何容器內查看當前生效的效果！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">不過別擔心，既然現在狀態效果僅以小圖示呈現，該怎麼知道當前效果的名稱呢？完全不用煩惱，我們已加入方便的懸停提示功能。當安裝了 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions</strong></span></a> 由 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>MehVahdJukaar</strong></span></a> 開發時</span></span>，此提示功能將更加實用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你喜歡原版物品欄的狀態效果顯示，想要保留它，甚至也想用在 HUD 上嗎？沒問題！你可以選擇任何你想要的模組模式，甚至是「無」。此外還有許多可自訂的設定，例如效果顯示的螢幕位置、行列數量、自訂透明度、文字顏色、自訂螢幕座標，以及更多更多設定。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 截圖：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/288/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/290/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Stylish Effects 實際運作效果，盡顯風格</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>可選擇並設定多種效果渲染類型</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/291/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/292/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>精簡效果顯示取代原版物品欄介面</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>效果顯示不僅限於背包，所有容器皆可見</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/293/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/294/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>滑鼠懸停於效果模組時將顯示實用提示</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>設定選項豐富，打造專屬你的效果顯示界面</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/295/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>優異的 JEI 與 REI 相容性</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q：我如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>A：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，即可直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q：我如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br><strong>A：</strong>目前尚未實作遊戲內直接編輯設定檔的功能。請在進入世界後，執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，並根據模組需求選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>。接著點擊聊天視窗中出現的副檔名為 <code>.toml</code> 的檔案名稱，即可在外部編輯器中手動修改設定檔。儲存檔案後，遊戲會在幾秒後自動重新載入設定，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q：我要如何下載 Minecraft 1.19 之前版本的 Fabric 模組？</strong><br><strong>A：</strong>舊版下載點請至 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>專案舊頁面</strong></span></a> 查找。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Stylish Effects 的開發過程中曾獲得以下靈感與協助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/deadzoke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Deadzoke</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ignitehud\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ignite HUD</span></a> 模組啟發了效果持續時間顯示功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dmitrylovin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Dmitrylovin</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Inventory HUD+</span></a> 模組啟發了精簡版效果等級顯示功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mag_icus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mag_icus</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/status-effect-timer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Status Effect Timer</span></a> 模組啟發了精簡版效果持續時間顯示功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/snownee_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Snownee</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mini Effects</span></a> 模組提供了一個小修改，用於禁用預設 JEI 物品欄狀態效果處理邏輯</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
